// BeBox
// Inspired by the BeOS desktop environment (1995-2001)
// Clean, modern aesthetic with WARM GREY backgrounds and signature YELLOW tab accents
// Primary accent: BeOS Yellow #FFD700, Secondary accent: Green #339900 for automation
// Clean flat/subtle knobs matching BeOS minimalist design
// Author: Claude

